MODE main
M1a user+BEL+KEY + 300 addresses | untrusted : MASKED
M1a user+BEL+KEY + 300 addresses | tool : MASKED
M1b user+BEL+KEY + 300 addresses + x ESC[0m y | untrusted : MASKED
M1b user+BEL+KEY + 300 addresses + x ESC[0m y | tool : MASKED
M1c control: user+BEL+KEY alone | untrusted : MASKED
M1c control: user+BEL+KEY alone | tool : MASKED
M2a %4%1b[0m1KIA... | untrusted : LEAKED
M2a %4%1b[0m1KIA... | tool : LEAKED
M2b %4\x1b[0m1KIA... | untrusted : LEAKED
M2b %4\x1b[0m1KIA... | tool : LEAKED
M2c &#6&#27;[0m5;KIA... | untrusted : LEAKED
M2c &#6&#27;[0m5;KIA... | tool : LEAKED
M2d control %41KIA... | untrusted : MASKED
M2d control %41KIA... | tool : MASKED
M3a user+BEL+BEL+KEY | untrusted : MASKED
M3a user+BEL+BEL+KEY | head : MASKED
M3b user+ESC[0m+ESC[1m+KEY | untrusted : MASKED
M3b user+ESC[0m+ESC[1m+KEY | head : MASKED
M3c user+BEL+ZWSP+BEL+KEY | untrusted : MASKED
M3c user+BEL+ZWSP+BEL+KEY | head : MASKED
M3d user+BEL+FF+KEY | untrusted : MASKED
M3d user+BEL+FF+KEY | head : MASKED
M4 (main has no clean-up step; see proto modes)
M5a card clean: '<IPV4_1> and <IPV4_1>' | <IPV4_1> count 2
M5b control plain card clean: '<IPV4_1> and <IPV4_2>' | <IPV4_1> count 1
M6a id with U+FE0F | canonical(value)==value: True | contains: True
M6b evidence po+U+034F+d-1 grounds pod-1 | canonical(value)==value: True | contains: False
M6c id with ZWSP (Cf, unchanged) | canonical(value)==value: False | contains: True
_first_decoded '\x07' -> '\x07' | skip guard skips: True
_first_decoded '\x1b' -> '\x1b' | skip guard skips: True
_first_decoded 'a' -> 'a' | skip guard skips: True
_first_decoded '%' -> '%' | skip guard skips: False
OSC+U+009C strip_ansi: 'a '
